README.md:3:A customer-support agent for a fictional outdoor store, Northwind Gear. The LLM decides which tools to call (orders, shipping, stock, policies, returns, callbacks). The backend validates every call, retries flaky upstream APIs, waits for the customer's approval before anything that changes their account, and streams a live trace of every step to the UI.
